<GuideLayout
  title="Privacy policy of this Canadian salary calculator 2026"
  description="How Salary After Tax Canada handles your data. No personal salary or financial data is collected, stored, or transmitted. All calculations run in your browser."
  publishDate="2025-01-15"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]}
>
  <p><em>Last updated: January 15, 2025</em></p>

  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>
    Salary After Tax Canada is a static website. All calculations run entirely in your browser.
    We do not collect, store, or transmit any salary or personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Collection</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>We do not collect any personal data.</strong> Specifically:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>No salary, income, or financial information is sent to any server.</li>
    <li>No account registration is required.</li>
    <li>No cookies are used for tracking purposes.</li>
    <li>No personal information is sold to third parties.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How the Calculator Works</h2>
  <p>
    All tax calculations are performed client-side in your web browser using JavaScript. The numbers you enter
    never leave your device. When you share a URL with calculator parameters (e.g., salary amount and province),
    that information is encoded in the URL hash fragment, which is not sent to servers.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We may use privacy-respecting analytics (such as aggregate page view counts) that do not track individual
    users or use cookies. No personally identifiable information is collected through analytics.
  </p>

  <h2>Local Storage</h2>
  <p>
    The website may use your browser's local storage to save your theme preference (light/dark mode).
    This data stays on your device and is not transmitted anywhere.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted on static hosting infrastructure. We do not use third-party advertising,
    tracking pixels, or social media widgets that could collect your data.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page
    with an updated date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this privacy policy, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.
  </p>
